WEBVTT

00:00:09.188 --> 00:00:11.468
You miss your dad,
don't you, Sharkbait?

00:00:11.548 --> 00:00:12.668
Yeah.

00:00:12.748 --> 00:00:16.628
Well, you're lucky to have someone
out there who's looking for you.

00:00:16.708 --> 00:00:18.908
He's not looking for me.

00:00:18.988 --> 00:00:21.028
He's scared of the ocean.

00:00:22.628 --> 00:00:23.908
Peach? Any movement?

00:00:23.988 --> 00:00:26.668
He's had four cups of coffee.
It's got to be soon.

00:00:26.948 --> 00:00:28.468
Keep on him.

00:00:31.148 --> 00:00:33.948
My first escape, landed on dental tools.

00:00:34.028 --> 00:00:36.348
-I was aiming for the toilet.
-The toilet?

00:00:36.428 --> 00:00:39.308
All drains lead to the ocean, kid.

00:00:39.388 --> 00:00:42.428
Wow. How many times
have you tried to get out?

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:47.508
I've lost count. Fish aren't meant to be
in a box, kid. It does things to you.

00:00:47.628 --> 00:00:49.748
The bubbles, the bubbles!

00:00:49.828 --> 00:00:53.868
Potty break! He just grabbed the
Reader's Digest. We have 4.2 minutes.

00:00:53.948 --> 00:00:55.548
That's your cue.

00:00:55.628 --> 00:00:57.988
-You can do it, kid.
-We got to be quick.

00:00:58.068 --> 00:01:02.388
Once you get in, swim to the bottom
and I'll talk you through the rest.

00:01:02.468 --> 00:01:03.468
Okay.

00:01:03.548 --> 00:01:05.908
-Go on. It'll be a piece of kelp.
-(TAKES A DEEP BREATH)

00:01:14.108 --> 00:01:16.708
-Nicely done. Can you hear me?
-Yeah.

00:01:16.788 --> 00:01:18.708
Here comes the pebble.

00:01:24.908 --> 00:01:28.468
-Now, do you see a small opening?
-Uh-huh.

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:31.668
Okay. Inside it you'll see a rotating fan.

00:01:31.748 --> 00:01:36.148
Very carefully, wedge that pebble
into the fan to stop it turning.

00:01:40.748 --> 00:01:42.068
Careful, Sharkbait.

00:01:42.148 --> 00:01:44.828
-I can't do it.
-This isn't a good idea.

00:01:44.908 --> 00:01:46.628
He'll be fine. Try again!

00:01:46.908 --> 00:01:48.308
Okay.

00:01:49.388 --> 00:01:52.028
GILL: That's it, Sharkbait.

00:01:52.148 --> 00:01:54.428
Nice and steady.

00:01:56.908 --> 00:01:59.868
-I got it, I got it!
-He did it.

00:01:59.948 --> 00:02:03.148
That's great, kid.
Now swim up the tube and out.

00:02:20.708 --> 00:02:22.708
Oh, no! Gill!

00:02:23.468 --> 00:02:25.708
Sharkbait! Get him out of there!

00:02:25.788 --> 00:02:27.348
-Help him!
-What do we do?

00:02:27.428 --> 00:02:30.308
-Oh, no!
-Stay calm, kid. Just don't panic.

00:02:31.788 --> 00:02:34.988
-Help me!
-Sharkbait, grab hold of this.

00:02:38.628 --> 00:02:39.668
No!

00:02:39.748 --> 00:02:41.628
-Feed me more.
-That's it!

00:02:41.708 --> 00:02:43.868
Come on, Sharkbait. Grab it.

00:02:45.468 --> 00:02:47.468
-I got it.
-Pull!

00:02:55.228 --> 00:02:57.588
Gill, don't make him go back in there.

00:02:59.068 --> 00:03:02.428
No. We're done.

00:03:05.468 --> 00:03:06.868
(WHIMPERS)

00:03:16.508 --> 00:03:18.028
CRUSH: Dude?

00:03:19.348 --> 00:03:20.668
Dude?

00:03:21.468 --> 00:03:23.228
Focus, dude.

00:03:24.028 --> 00:03:25.268
Dude?

00:03:27.028 --> 00:03:28.548
He lives. Hey, dude.

00:03:28.748 --> 00:03:29.788
(MARLIN GROANS)

00:03:31.348 --> 00:03:34.268
-What happened?
-I saw the whole thing, dude.

00:03:34.348 --> 00:03:37.788
First you were all, like, whoa!
And then we were all, like, whoa!

00:03:37.868 --> 00:03:41.108
-Then you were, like, whoa...
-What are you talking about?

00:03:41.188 --> 00:03:48.028
You, mini-man! Taking on the jellies.
You got serious thrill issues, dude.

00:03:48.108 --> 00:03:49.388
Awesome.

00:03:49.828 --> 00:03:51.348
Oh, my stomach.

00:03:52.028 --> 00:03:55.228
Man, no hurling on the shell.
I just waxed it.

00:03:56.428 --> 00:03:59.748
-So, Mr. Turtle...
-Dude, Mr. Turtle is my father.

00:03:59.828 --> 00:04:01.308
Name's Crush.

00:04:01.628 --> 00:04:03.388
Crush? Really?

00:04:04.028 --> 00:04:05.228
Okay, Crush.

00:04:05.308 --> 00:04:08.668
Listen, I need to get to
the East Australian Current.

00:04:08.748 --> 00:04:10.268
EAC?

00:04:10.348 --> 00:04:11.868
Dude...

00:04:11.948 --> 00:04:14.148
You're riding it, dude.

00:04:14.228 --> 00:04:15.988
Check it out.

